WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:04.470
Alright, Pogchamp. You've probably seen
this dude's face when something hype or

00:00:04.470 --> 00:00:08.910
surprising happens on stream. But who the
hell is this guy and where did he come

00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:11.820
from? Well back in 2010 cross-counter TV

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:16.890
released a blooper reel featuring longtime
So Cal Street Fighter bros Ryan “Gootecks”

00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:21.580
Gutierrez and Mike Ross. In the video,
this happened.

00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:28.619
Youtubers loved Gootecks' unexpected
expression to the off-camera incident

00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:33.100
but no labels managed to accurately
describe its dankness,

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:38.480
A year later, Gootecks and Ross released a
promo for a Mad Catz Fight Stick using

00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:41.960
their goofy brand of humor and a random
game of pogs.

00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:47.399
Gootecks would stomp Ross using an

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:49.000
ingenious technique.

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:56.700
The term PogChamp was born and

00:00:56.700 --> 00:01:01.500
gradually attached itself to Gootecks's now iconic
face. "I remember I talked with Ryan

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:07.920
or I talked to Gootecks and I was like 'yo man
is that your face?' and he's like 'what are

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:12.000
you talking about.'" The fighting game
community fully embraced the meme and

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:17.250
in no time it spreads through the
internet via 4chan and Steam strangely

00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:19.880
becoming the face of Team Fortress 2
raffles.

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:25.200
It wasn't long before PogChamp was added
to Twitch chat where today it is still

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:29.970
one of the site's most used emotes. But
PogChamp's influence has extended even

00:01:29.970 --> 00:01:34.890
beyond gaming, becoming part of everyday
conversation. Find out your mom made

00:01:34.890 --> 00:01:38.939
lasagna for dinner?
PogChamp. They're making a sequel to your

00:01:38.940 --> 00:01:43.300
favorite movie? PogChamp. Finding out
you're not the father.

00:01:45.260 --> 00:01:49.580
Definitely PogChamp. Gootecks responded
favorably to the internet community's

00:01:49.580 --> 00:01:54.360
response to his face, harnessing the power
of PogChamp to build and develop his

00:01:54.360 --> 00:01:58.960
personal brand.
While Gootecks has become renowned for

00:01:58.979 --> 00:02:02.759
his amusing facial expressions over the
years, none have been able to generate

00:02:02.760 --> 00:02:06.420
the community response and reactionary
memes of PogChamp.

00:02:06.420 --> 00:02:11.340
"Man all the memes, man there's some talented people out there." And so ends this trip down meme-ory

00:02:11.340 --> 00:02:16.010
lane.
I'm Josh Bury and that was PogChamp.

